From 4222b927283fae8c3a5fe56cdb3667619210b0d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:13:40 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-PROF-001 wave 14: isolate named and off-the-record profiles

Use ProfileManager initialization and named OTR contexts with original-profile keepalives. Close tabs sequentially, await actual contents and OTR destruction, restore availability on veto, and cancel pending opens on shutdown. Preserve ABI 1.5 layouts and default-profile behavior; advertise additive profile APIs in ABI 1.6.

Last rebased: 2026-11-02 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
